      "interviewerPrompt": "People make mistakes. Let them undo a move, and make sure nobody loses their place when a button turns off.",
      "constraints": [
        "Add a button with the class `undo-move`. It undoes the last move, and pressing it again undoes the one before. It is disabled when there is nothing to undo.",
        "Undo puts both lists back in exactly the order they had before that move, and clears the selection in both lists.",
        "After a move, move focus to the title of the list the items went to. Give each `listTitle` `tabindex=\"-1\"`.",
        "Always keep one element with the class `transfer-status` and `aria-live=\"polite\"` on the page. It says `2 items moved to Bottom`, `1 item moved to Top` or `Move undone`."
